    Determines if the list is sorted in non-decreasing order with at most one consecutive duplicate.

    Parameters:
    data (list of int): The list of integers to check.

    Returns:
    bool: True if the list is sorted in non-decreasing order with at most one consecutive duplicate, False otherwise.
    """
    if not data:
