```python
def merge_genes(base_assembly_genes: dict, other_assembly_genes: dict) -> dict:
    """
    Merges two dictionaries of genome assemblies based on gene ID.
    In case of attribute conflicts, values from other_assembly_genes take precedence.
    The resulting dictionary is sorted by gene ID.

    :param base_assembly_genes: Dictionary representing the base genome assembly.
    :param other_assembly_genes: Dictionary representing the other genome assembly.
    :return: Merged dictionary of genes sorted by gene ID.
    """
    merged_genes = {}

    for gene_id, gene_info in base_assembly_genes.items():
        merged_genes[gene_id] = gene_info

    for gene_id, gene_info in other_assembly_genes.items():
        if gene_id in merged_genes:
            merged_genes[gene_id].update(gene_info)
        else:
            merged_genes[gene_id] = gene_info

    return dict(sorted(merged_genes.items()))
```

